{
 "help": {
  "tabs": [
   {
    "id": "overview",
    "title": "Overview",
    "content": "<p>Plugins extend and expand the functionality of WordPress. Once a plugin is installed, you may activate it or deactivate it here.</p><p>The search for installed plugins will search for terms in their name, description, or author. <span id=\"live-search-desc\" class=\"hide-if-no-js\">The search results will be updated as you type.</span></p><p>If you would like to see more plugins to choose from, click on the &#8220;Add Plugin&#8221; button and you will be able to browse or search for additional plugins from the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/\">WordPress Plugin Directory</a>. Plugins in the WordPress Plugin Directory are designed and developed by third parties, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses. Oh, and they are free!</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "compatibility-problems",
    "title": "Troubleshooting",
    "content": "<p>Most of the time, plugins play nicely with the core of WordPress and with other plugins. Sometimes, though, a plugin&#8217;s code will get in the way of another plugin, causing compatibility issues. If your site starts doing strange things, this may be the problem. Try deactivating all your plugins and re-activating them in various combinations until you isolate which one(s) caused the issue.</p><p>If something goes wrong with a plugin and you cannot use WordPress, delete or rename that file in the <code>/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins</code> directory and it will be automatically deactivated.</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "plugins-themes-auto-updates",
    "title": "Auto-updates",
    "content": "<p>Auto-updates can be enabled or disabled for each individual plugin. Plugins with auto-updates enabled will display the estimated date of the next auto-update. Auto-updates depends on the WP-Cron task scheduling system.</p><p>Auto-updates are only available for plugins recognized by WordPress.org, or that include a compatible update system.</p><p>Please note: Third-party themes and plugins, or custom code, may override WordPress scheduling.</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "plugins-dependencies",
    "title": "Dependencies",
    "content": "<p>Plugin Dependencies aims to make the process of installing and activating add-ons (dependents) and the plugins they rely on (dependencies) consistent and easy.</p><p>If a required plugin is deleted, a notice will be displayed on the Plugin administration screen informing the user that there is some missing dependencies to install and/or activate. Additionally, each plugin whose dependencies are not met will have an error notice on their plugin row.</p><p>If a dependent plugin is missing some dependencies, its activation button will be disabled until the required dependencies are activated.</p>"
   }
  ],
  "sidebar": "<p><strong>For more information:</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/manage-plugins/\">Documentation on Managing Plugins</a></p><p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/plugins-themes-auto-updates/\">Documentation on Auto-updates</a></p><p><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/forums/\">Support forums</a></p>"
 },
 "content": "\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-heading-inline\">\nPlugins</h1>\n\n\t<a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php\" class=\"page-title-action\">Add Plugin</a>\n\t\n<hr class=\"wp-header-end\">\n\n\n<h2 class='screen-reader-text'>Filter plugins list</h2><ul class='subsubsub'>\n\t<li class='all'><a href=\"plugins.php?plugin_status=all\" class=\"current\" aria-current=\"page\">All <span class=\"count\">(2)</span></a> |</li>\n\t<li class='inactive'><a href=\"plugins.php?plugin_status=inactive\">Inactive <span class=\"count\">(2)</span></a> |</li>\n\t<li class='mustuse'><a href=\"plugins.php?plugin_status=mustuse\">Must-Use <span class=\"count\">(2)</span></a> |</li>\n\t<li class='auto-update-disabled'><a href=\"plugins.php?plugin_status=auto-update-disabled\">Auto-updates Disabled <span class=\"count\">(2)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<form class=\"search-form search-plugins\" method=\"get\">\n\t\t<p class=\"search-box\">\n\t\t\t<label for=\"plugin-search-input\">Search installed plugins</label>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"search\" id=\"plugin-search-input\" class=\"wp-filter-search\" name=\"s\" value=\"\" />\n\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" id=\"search-submit\" class=\"button hide-if-js\" value=\"Search installed plugins\"  />\t\t</p>\n\t\t</form>\n\n<form method=\"post\" id=\"bulk-action-form\">\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"plugin_status\" value=\"all\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"paged\" value=\"1\" />\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_wpnonce\" name=\"_wpnonce\" value=\"d532d85e48\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/wp-admin/plugins.php\" />\t<div class=\"tablenav top\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"alignleft actions bulkactions\">\n\t\t\t<label for=\"bulk-action-selector-top\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select bulk action</label><select name=\"action\" id=\"bulk-action-selector-top\">\n<option value=\"-1\">Bulk actions</option>\n\t<option value=\"activate-selected\">Activate</option>\n\t<option value=\"deactivate-selected\">Deactivate</option>\n\t<option value=\"update-selected\">Update</option>\n\t<option value=\"delete-selected\">Delete</option>\n\t<option value=\"enable-auto-update-selected\">Enable Auto-updates</option>\n\t<option value=\"disable-auto-update-selected\">Disable Auto-updates</option>\n</select>\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"bulk_action\" id=\"doaction\" class=\"button action button-compact\" value=\"Apply\"  />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='tablenav-pages one-page'><span class=\"displaying-num\">2 items</span>\n<span class='pagination-links'><span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&laquo;</span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&lsaquo;</span>\n<span class=\"paging-input\"><label for=\"current-page-selector\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">Current Page</label><input class='current-page' id='current-page-selector' type='text'\n\t\t\t\t\tname='paged' value='1' size='1' aria-describedby='table-paging' /><span class='tablenav-paging-text'> of <span class='total-pages'>1</span></span></span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rsaquo;</span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&raquo;</span></span></div>\n\t\t<br class=\"clear\" />\n\t</div>\n\t\t<h2 class='screen-reader-text'>Plugins list</h2><table class=\"wp-list-table widefat plugins\">\n\t\t\t<thead>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td  id='cb' class='manage-column column-cb check-column'  ><input id=\"cb-select-all-1\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n\t\t\t<label for=\"cb-select-all-1\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select All</span></label></td><th scope=\"col\" id='name' class='manage-column column-name column-primary'  >Plugin</th><th scope=\"col\" id='description' class='manage-column column-description'  >Description</th><th scope=\"col\" id='auto-updates' class='manage-column column-auto-updates'  >Automatic Updates</th>\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\n\t<tbody id=\"the-list\"\n\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t<tr class=\"inactive\" data-slug=\"akismet\" data-plugin=\"akismet/akismet.php\"><td class='check-column'><label class=\"label-covers-full-cell\" for=\"checkbox_1a03f1c70286d2ea118f953c968249d2\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection</span></label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"checked[]\" value=\"akismet/akismet.php\" id=\"checkbox_1a03f1c70286d2ea118f953c968249d2\" /></td><th scope='row' class='plugin-title column-primary' aria-label='Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection'><strong>Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection</strong><div class=\"row-actions visible\"><span class='activate'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=activate&amp;plugin=akismet%2Fakismet.php&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;paged=1&amp;s&amp;_wpnonce=1ed196904b\" id=\"activate-akismet\" class=\"edit\" aria-label=\"Activate Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection\">Activate</a> | </span><span class='delete'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=delete-selected&amp;checked%5B0%5D=akismet%2Fakismet.php&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;paged=1&amp;s&amp;_wpnonce=d532d85e48\" id=\"delete-akismet\" class=\"delete\" aria-label=\"Delete Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection\">Delete</a></span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-row\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Show more details</span></button></th><td class='column-description desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class='plugin-description'><p>Used by millions, Akismet is quite possibly the best way in the world to <strong>protect your blog from spam</strong>. Akismet Anti-spam keeps your site protected even while you sleep. To get started: activate the Akismet plugin and then go to your Akismet Settings page to set up your API key.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class='inactive second plugin-version-author-uri'>Version 5.7.2 | By <a href=\"https://automattic.com/wordpress-plugins/\">Automattic - Anti-spam Team</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=akismet&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"More information about Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection\" data-title=\"Akismet Anti-spam: Spam Protection\">View details</a></div></td><td class='column-auto-updates'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=enable-auto-update&amp;plugin=akismet%2Fakismet.php&amp;paged=1&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;_wpnonce=3e14527ebd\" class=\"toggle-auto-update aria-button-if-js\" data-wp-action=\"enable\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-update spin hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"label\">Enable auto-updates</span></a><div class=\"notice notice-error notice-alt inline hidden\"><p></p></div></td></tr><tr class=\"inactive\" data-slug=\"hello-dolly\" data-plugin=\"hello.php\"><td class='check-column'><label class=\"label-covers-full-cell\" for=\"checkbox_86d67fa5699ad8207570ec9a4315af2c\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select Hello Dolly</span></label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"checked[]\" value=\"hello.php\" id=\"checkbox_86d67fa5699ad8207570ec9a4315af2c\" /></td><th scope='row' class='plugin-title column-primary' aria-label='Hello Dolly'><strong>Hello Dolly</strong><div class=\"row-actions visible\"><span class='activate'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=activate&amp;plugin=hello.php&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;paged=1&amp;s&amp;_wpnonce=1861feb71d\" id=\"activate-hello-dolly\" class=\"edit\" aria-label=\"Activate Hello Dolly\">Activate</a> | </span><span class='delete'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=delete-selected&amp;checked%5B0%5D=hello.php&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;paged=1&amp;s&amp;_wpnonce=d532d85e48\" id=\"delete-hello-dolly\" class=\"delete\" aria-label=\"Delete Hello Dolly\">Delete</a></span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"toggle-row\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Show more details</span></button></th><td class='column-description desc'>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class='plugin-description'><p>This is not just a plugin, it symbolizes the hope and enthusiasm of an entire generation summed up in two words sung most famously by Louis Armstrong: Hello, Dolly. When activated you will randomly see a lyric from Hello, Dolly in the upper right of your admin screen on every page.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class='inactive second plugin-version-author-uri'>Version 1.7.2 | By <a href=\"http://ma.tt/\">Matt Mullenweg</a> | <a href=\"{{site}}/wp-admin/plugin-install.php?tab=plugin-information&#038;plugin=hello-dolly&#038;TB_iframe=true&#038;width=600&#038;height=550\" class=\"thickbox open-plugin-details-modal\" aria-label=\"More information about Hello Dolly\" data-title=\"Hello Dolly\">View details</a></div></td><td class='column-auto-updates'><a href=\"plugins.php?action=enable-auto-update&amp;plugin=hello.php&amp;paged=1&amp;plugin_status=all&amp;_wpnonce=3e14527ebd\" class=\"toggle-auto-update aria-button-if-js\" data-wp-action=\"enable\"><span class=\"dashicons dashicons-update spin hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"label\">Enable auto-updates</span></a><div class=\"notice notice-error notice-alt inline hidden\"><p></p></div></td></tr>\t</tbody>\n\n\t<tfoot>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td   class='manage-column column-cb check-column'  ><input id=\"cb-select-all-2\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n\t\t\t<label for=\"cb-select-all-2\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select All</span></label></td><th scope=\"col\"  class='manage-column column-name column-primary'  >Plugin</th><th scope=\"col\"  class='manage-column column-description'  >Description</th><th scope=\"col\"  class='manage-column column-auto-updates'  >Automatic Updates</th>\t</tr>\n\t</tfoot>\n\n</table>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tablenav bottom\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"alignleft actions bulkactions\">\n\t\t\t<label for=\"bulk-action-selector-bottom\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">Select bulk action</label><select name=\"action2\" id=\"bulk-action-selector-bottom\">\n<option value=\"-1\">Bulk actions</option>\n\t<option value=\"activate-selected\">Activate</option>\n\t<option value=\"deactivate-selected\">Deactivate</option>\n\t<option value=\"update-selected\">Update</option>\n\t<option value=\"delete-selected\">Delete</option>\n\t<option value=\"enable-auto-update-selected\">Enable Auto-updates</option>\n\t<option value=\"disable-auto-update-selected\">Disable Auto-updates</option>\n</select>\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"bulk_action\" id=\"doaction2\" class=\"button action button-compact\" value=\"Apply\"  />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class='tablenav-pages one-page'><span class=\"displaying-num\">2 items</span>\n<span class='pagination-links'><span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&laquo;</span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&lsaquo;</span>\n<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Current Page</span><span id=\"table-paging\" class=\"paging-input\"><span class=\"tablenav-paging-text\">1 of <span class='total-pages'>1</span></span></span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rsaquo;</span>\n<span class=\"tablenav-pages-navspan button disabled\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&raquo;</span></span></div>\n\t\t<br class=\"clear\" />\n\t</div>\n\t\t</form>\n\n\t<span class=\"spinner\"></span>\n</div>\n\n\t<script id=\"tmpl-wp-updates-admin-notice\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t\t<div <# if ( data.id ) { #>id=\"{{ data.id }}\"<# } #> class=\"notice {{ data.className }}\"><p>{{{ data.message }}}</p></div>\n\t</script>\n\t<script id=\"tmpl-wp-bulk-updates-admin-notice\" type=\"text/html\">\n\t\t<div id=\"{{ data.id }}\" class=\"{{ data.className }} notice <# if ( data.errorMessage ) { #>notice-error<# } else { #>notice-success<# } #>\">\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.successMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t{{{ data.successMessage }}}\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.errorMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"button-link bulk-action-errors-collapsed\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t{{{ data.errorMessage }}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tShow more details\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"toggle-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t<# if ( data.errorMessages ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bulk-action-errors hidden\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<# _.each( data.errorMessages, function( errorMessage ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>{{ errorMessage }}</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<# } ); #>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</script>\n\t\t<script id=\"tmpl-item-update-row\" type=\"text/template\">\n\t\t<tr class=\"plugin-update-tr update\" id=\"{{ data.slug }}-update\" data-slug=\"{{ data.slug }}\" <# if ( data.plugin ) { #>data-plugin=\"{{ data.plugin }}\"<# } #>>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"{{ data.colspan }}\" class=\"plugin-update colspanchange\">\n\t\t\t\t{{{ data.content }}}\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</script>\n\t<script id=\"tmpl-item-deleted-row\" type=\"text/template\">\n\t\t<tr class=\"plugin-deleted-tr inactive deleted\" id=\"{{ data.slug }}-deleted\" data-slug=\"{{ data.slug }}\" <# if ( data.plugin ) { #>data-plugin=\"{{ data.plugin }}\"<# } #>>\n\t\t\t<td colspan=\"{{ data.colspan }}\" class=\"plugin-update colspanchange\">\n\t\t\t\t<# if ( data.plugin ) { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>{{{ data.name }}}</strong> was successfully deleted.\t\t\t\t<# } else { #>\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>{{{ data.name }}}</strong> was successfully deleted.\t\t\t\t<# } #>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</script>\n\t\n"
}